{'symbol': 'XEL', 'date': '2022-06-22 14:17:00', 'title': 'XCEL ENERGY ELECTS NEW BOARD MEMBER', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--XCEL ENERGY INC. (NASDAQ: XEL) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MEGAN BURKHART HAS BEEN ELECTED TO THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY. BURKHART IS AN ACCOMPLISHED EXECUTIVE WITH DECADES OF EXPERIENCE IN HUMAN RESOURCES (HR), COMPENSATION, CULTURE, AND DIVERSITY, EQUITY AND INCLUSION (DE&I). SHE CURRENTLY SERVES AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, CHIEF HUMAN RESOURCES OFFICER AT COMERICA INCORPORATED, A MAJOR FINANCIAL SERVICES COMPANY HEADQUARTERED IN DALLAS,"}